<title>FRANCE: Pechiney nine month sales slip.</title>
<headline>Pechiney nine month sales slip.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					49,085    vs   51,033</p>
<p>    -- aluminium				  15,349    vs   17,144</p>
<p>    -- packaging				  18,199    vs   17,597</p>
<p>    -- diverse industrial activities	 2,244    vs    2,470</p>
<p>    -- international trade		    13,293    vs   13,822</p>
<p>Third quarter to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>    Turnover					16,176    vs   16,535</p>
<p>    -- aluminium				   4,702    vs    5,349</p>
<p>    -- packaging				   6,265    vs    5,978</p>
<p>    -- diverse industrial activities	   644    vs	784</p>
<p>    -- international trade		     4,565    vs    4,424</p>
<p>NOTE - Pechiney gave the figures in a statement. It said the 1995 comparisons were pro-forma to reflect the changes in the field of consolidation.</p>
</text>
